:: Mine Night Passout
<<effects>>

<<if $mine.hope gte 30>>
	<<generate1>>
	You wake up with your head lying on something soft. You open your eyes and are met with a <<person1>><<person>> staring down at you. You lift your head from <<his>> lap. <<He>> makes sure you're okay before you stand up.
<<else>>
	You wake up with your head lying on the hard rock. You open your eyes to see everybody ignoring you. Your head aches as you stand up. <<pain 5>> <<gpain>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>



