:: Mine Job Minecart Passout
<<effects>><<generate1>><<person1>>
A jostling movement awakens you. You're lying in a metal container. Lights float by overhead.
<br><br>

A <<person>> peers at you over the rim. "Just in time," <<he>> says. The container comes to a halt, and <<he>> grasps your shoulders. From this high up, you can see more of your surroundings. You're lying in a mine cart, on a track in some forgotten corner of the mines.
<br><br>

<<He>> pulls you from the cart. While you're still unsteady, <<he>> trips you up and pushes <<himself>> atop you.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecart Passout Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>



